# mimo-streak demo
# High-quality terminal recording

Output mimo-streak.gif

Set Width 960
Set Height 540
Set FontSize 18
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set LineHeight 1.2
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "TokyoNightStorm"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0
Set BorderRadius 12
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set WindowBarSize 36

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Type "mimo-streak"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "mimo-streak models"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s

Type "mimo-streak projects"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s

Type "mimo-streak trends"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s

Type "mimo-streak --help"
Enter
Sleep 2s
